":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# YuE2: Music Cover\n\nSheetSage2 transcribes the reference audio into ABC. The final edited score feeds both Native generation and the automatic duration budget.\n\n- **Mode:** `melody` is recommended for most covers; `full` uses a fuller plan.\n- **Tempo Mode:** `keep`, `override`, or `multiplier`.\n- **Vocal Mode:** `nearest_key_safe`, `nearest_octave`, or `manual`; manual shift is vocal-only.\n- **Target Voice:** pitch range only. Describe vocal gender and timbre in **Style**.\n- **Transpose Semitones (Whole Score)** changes all score parts; **Vocal Manual Semitones** changes only vocal ABC.\n- **Adapter (LoRA / LoKr):** Universal Adapter with independent AR / NAR strength.\n- Recommended sampler: `dpm_2` + `sgm_uniform`. Duration budget is a ceiling, not a target.\n\nRequired models: [YuE2 checkpoint](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE/resolve/main/checkpoints/yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors) and [SheetSage2 encoder](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE/resolve/main/audio_encoders/sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors)."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# YuE2: Music Cover\n\nSheetSage2 transcribes the reference audio into ABC. The final edited score feeds both Native generation and the automatic duration budget.\n\n- **Mode:** `melody` is recommended for most covers; `full` uses a fuller plan.\n- **Tempo Mode:** `keep`, `override`, or `multiplier`.\n- **Vocal Mode:** `nearest_key_safe`, `nearest_octave`, or `manual`; manual shift is vocal-only.\n- **Target Voice:** pitch range only. Describe vocal gender and timbre in **Style**.\n- **Transpose Semitones (Whole Score)** changes all score parts; **Vocal Manual Semitones** changes only vocal ABC.\n- **Adapter (LoRA / LoKr):** Universal Adapter with independent AR / NAR strength.\n- Recommended sampler: `dpm_2` + `sgm_uniform`. Duration budget is a ceiling, not a target.\